% UVB shielding one-zone driver: zoom parameters (L10, stella_dev zoom branches) in a small comoving box at z = 6.5
InitCondFile        sgchem_uvb_shielding_ics
ICFormat            3
OutputDir           output
SnapshotFileBase    snapshot
SnapFormat          3
NumFilesPerSnapshot 1
TimeLimitCPU        3600
CpuTimeBetRestartFile  100000
ComovingIntegrationOn  1
TimeBegin           0.133333        % z=6.5
TimeMax             0.134
Omega0              0.31
OmegaLambda         0.69
OmegaBaryon         0.049
HubbleParam         0.68
BoxSize             1.0             % ckpc/h
OutputListOn        0
TimeOfFirstSnapshot 0.134
TimeBetSnapshot     1.1
TimeBetStatistics   1.01
MaxMemSize          2000
PartAllocFactor     2.0
BufferSize          100
UnitLength_in_cm            3.085678e21
UnitMass_in_g               1.989e43
UnitVelocity_in_cm_per_s    1e5
UnitMagneticField_in_gauss  1.0
GravityConstantInternal     0
MaxSizeTimestep     0.01            % dln(a)
MinSizeTimestep     0
TreeDomainUpdateFrequency  0.05
DesNumNgb           32
AGS_DesNumNgb       32
MaxKernelRadius     1.0             % ckpc/h
InitGasTemp         0               % IC temperature
MinGasTemp          10.0
SofteningGas        0.004      % min of adaptive gas softening
SofteningHalo       0.048      % high-res DM type 1 (~1/30 of spacing)
SofteningDisk       0.2             % coarse DM type 2 (levels 8-11)
SofteningBulge      0
SofteningStars      0.004
SofteningBndry      0
SofteningGasMaxPhys    0.0004
SofteningHaloMaxPhys   0.01
SofteningDiskMaxPhys   0.2
SofteningBulgeMaxPhys  0
SofteningStarsMaxPhys  0.0004
SofteningBndryMaxPhys  0
% ---- Stella production parameters (stella_cloud.params, stella_dev 22017b407) ----
CritPhysDensity                 100.
SfEffPerFreeFall                0.5
FacSfThreshMJ                   1.0
TimeInstantSN                   0.0
IMFSampleMinMass                0.08
ResolvedISM_SFCooldownFreeFallFraction 0.1
IMFSampleStellarMassCut         0.5
StellarTablesFile               gizmo/galaxy_sf/stellar_tables/stellar_tables_unified.hdf5
MaxStellarTimestep              10000.0
InitMetallicity                 0.0             % pristine (net 17), as the zooms
InitialMetallicity              0.0
InitStellarAge                  10.0
BiniX                           0
BiniY                           0
BiniZ                           1.0e-12         % physical Gauss at z=50 (seed; first guess)
ShieldingLength                 0.034           % 50 pc physical in kpc/h
G0                              0.0             % no FUV floor in the zooms (Uli 2026-11-10); UVB from TREECOOL
CosmicRayIonRate                3.0e-17         % scaled by G0_local/1.7 (CR_SCALE_WITH_G0), floor 1e-21
DGRnormalized                   1.0
DeutAbund                       2.6e-5
MaxPISearchRadius               0.05            % physical kpc
